{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "403bc7b7-30a2-8fc6-93c1-47065c8af6ec",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T11:20:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey Kevin, hon, it's Nelson Medeiros. Listen, I got a manhole cover on my street that's sunk down into the pavement and it's driving me nuts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:19:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sunk down. Is it sitting lower than the road around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, lower, and it rings. Every time a car goes over it, clunk, clunk. All day long. Sounds like somebody's banging a pot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, those get loud. About how big is the cover, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, hang on, one sec, I'm texting my brother-in-law back here. [pause] Sorry, hon, what'd you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. How big is the cover, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, about two feet across. Round, you know, the regular kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, two feet, round. And where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "474 Narragansett Avenue. Right out front, in the travel lane. Can you just put the street on the repair list? I'd love it if somebody got out here before the plows start tearing it up even worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll write that up: 474 Narragansett Avenue, sunken manhole cover, about two feet, rings when vehicles cross. I'll get it added to the list for the crew to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Does it need my number? It's 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one six four. Got it. If the crew has questions they'll reach out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks Kevin. Appreciate it, hon. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Nelson. Bye now."
    }
  ],
